nd I don't believe in you and  just one does and it changes your whole  life and I feel the same way about  Bradley you know Bradley believed in me  and you know I really believed in him  and I still do all the time and I think  that shows itself in this film I think  you know if we didn't have that actual  connection and friendship you know  behind the scenes that it would be very  different but he captured the honesty of  our you know private friendship as well  as you know the the love story and the  trust that they have with each other and  how much they believe in each other and  how that makes their love soar
 

